        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "the  Consolidated guidelines on HIV prevention, testing, treatment, service delivery and monitoring:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        364.67919921875,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": ". recommendations for a public health approach, 2021 update (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.056396484375,
        354.8602600097656,
        144.6313934326172
      ],
      "text": "3.3.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.43212890625,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "ARV drugs play a key role in HIV prevention. People living with HIV who have an undetectable viral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4202270507812,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "load and continue taking medication as prescribed have zero risk of transmitting HIV to their sexual",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.427734375,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "partner(s). Furthermore, people living with HIV who have a suppressed but detectable (detected but",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4190063476562,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "≤ 1000 copies/mL) viral load and are taking medication as prescribed have almost zero or negligible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        316.16748046875,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "risk of transmitting HIV to their sexual partner(s)  . (127)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.3946533203125,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "TB among pregnant women living with HIV is associated with a 2.5-fold increased risk of vertical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        524.3956909179688,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "transmission of HIV  . ART during pregnancy and breastfeeding can effectively prevent mother- (128)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4379272460938,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "to-child transmission of HIV. ARV drugs taken by people without HIV as pre-exposure prophylaxis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.393798828125,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "(PrEP) and post-exposure prophylaxis (PEP) are also highly effective in preventing HIV acquisition.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.3981323242188,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Other key biomedical measures to prevent HIV transmission include provision of male and female",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4180297851562,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "condoms; voluntary medical male circumcision; and harm reduction services, such as needle and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4215698242188,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "syringe programmes and opioid agonist maintenance therapy, for people who inject drugs  .  (21, 97)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4278564453125,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Behavioural interventions to prevent HIV include approaches to delivering targeted information",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.433349609375,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and education about HIV prevention. Structural interventions aim to remove structural barriers to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.3958129882812,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "accessing services by addressing the social, legal and political environment that contribute to HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4376220703125,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "transmission, for example by reducing stigma and discrimination, promoting gender equality and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        293.5754699707031,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "supporting economic and social empowerment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4300537109375,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "It is essential to prevent transmission of HIV in healthcare settings through primary prevention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.3815307617188,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "measures such as standard precautions, injection safety, blood safety and safe waste disposal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4300537109375,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "including of infectious and sharps waste, as well as through secondary prevention measures such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4320678710938,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "as occupational PEP following needle stick injuries  . Facility management in each healthcare  (10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4343872070312,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "facility should ensure that there is a suitable segregation, transport and storage system for waste",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4244384765625,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "management in place and that all staff adhere to these procedures, in accordance with standardized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.3975219726562,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "national systems for healthcare waste management  . Details on safe management of healthcare  (129)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        501.2123718261719,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "waste are outlined in  . Safe management of wastes from health-care activities: a summary (129)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4188842773438,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "WHO has defined five key populations who are at higher risk of acquiring HIV: men who have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.42333984375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "sex with men, sex workers, people in prisons and other closed settings, people who inject drugs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4248657226562,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "and trans and gender diverse people  . Members of these populations are often at elevated  (30)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4223022460938,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "risk of also acquiring TB, depending on the context, regardless of HIV status. Guidance specific to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4395141601562,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "these key populations can be found in the WHO  Consolidated guidelines on HIV, viral hepatitis and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.415283203125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": ", as well as the consolidated  STI prevention, diagnosis, treatment and care for key populations (30)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4531860351562,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "guidelines on  Integrating collaborative TB and HIV services within a comprehensive package of care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
